{"seq":14,"slug":"combinatorics","title":"组合数学","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics","rating":{"composite":3.79,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.23,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"组合数学-简介\">组合数学 简介</h1><p>组合数学研究离散对象的<strong>计数、存在性与构造</strong>：在给定约束下，某种离散结构有多少种、是否存在、如何造出来。从古典排列组合到现代图着色、编码理论与算法分析，组合数学是计算机科学、统计学与运筹学的共同底座。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位与边界\">本 hub 的定位与边界</h2><p>本知识库聚焦组合数学的<strong>核心方法论</strong>——把&quot;如何计数、如何证明存在、如何构造平衡结构&quot;讲透，并在每一处指向其上下游应用 hub。它与几个兄弟 hub 分工明确，避免重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>关系与分工</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../discrete-mathematics/\">离散数学</a></td>\n<td>离散数学是&quot;概览&quot;，含集合逻辑、自动机、代数结构；其<a href=\"../discrete-mathematics/combinatorics/\">组合计数子章</a>只做入门，深入的生成函数/容斥/设计在本 hub</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../graph-theory/\">图论</a></td>\n<td>图论以&quot;图结构&quot;为对象（连通、着色、网络流）；本 hub 提供其计数与存在性工具（Ramsey、Pólya、匹配的对偶）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../probability-statistics/\">概率统计</a></td>\n<td>概率统计研究随机性；本 hub 为古典概型提供样本点计数，并经&quot;概率方法&quot;反哺组合存在性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../number-theory/\">数论</a></td>\n<td>数论与本 hub 在筛法、莫比乌斯反演、Lucas 定理处交汇；同余/素数理论留在数论 hub</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../abstract-algebra/\">抽象代数</a></td>\n<td>群、有限域是组合设计（MOLS、差集、Pólya）的构造引擎；代数结构本身留在代数 hub</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"章节地图\">章节地图</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    C1[&quot;①计数原理&lt;br/&gt;加乘原理·排列组合·二项式·多项式&quot;] --&gt; C2[&quot;②递推与生成函数&lt;br/&gt;递推求解·OGF/EGF·Catalan&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C3[&quot;③容斥与鸽巢&lt;br/&gt;容斥·错位·筛法·Ramsey·概率方法&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; C4[&quot;④组合设计与应用&lt;br/&gt;拉丁方·BIBD·Pólya·组合优化&quot;]&#10;    C3 --&gt; C4\">flowchart LR\n    C1[\"①计数原理&lt;br/&gt;加乘原理·排列组合·二项式·多项式\"] --&gt; C2[\"②递推与生成函数&lt;br/&gt;递推求解·OGF/EGF·Catalan\"]\n    C1 --&gt; C3[\"③容斥与鸽巢&lt;br/&gt;容斥·错位·筛法·Ramsey·概率方法\"]\n    C2 --&gt; C4[\"④组合设计与应用&lt;br/&gt;拉丁方·BIBD·Pólya·组合优化\"]\n    C3 --&gt; C4</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 计数原理</strong>：加法/乘法原理、排列与组合、二项式定理、多项式定理，建立计数工具箱。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 递推与生成函数</strong>：从建立递推到特征方程法、主定理，再到 OGF/EGF 编码序列，以 Catalan 数为典范。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 容斥与鸽巢原理</strong>：&quot;减法计数&quot;（容斥、错位排列、筛法）与&quot;存在性论证&quot;（鸽巢、Ramsey、概率方法）两大范式。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章 组合设计与应用</strong>：拉丁方与正交设计、区组设计 BIBD、Pólya 计数、组合优化，连接实验设计、密码学与算法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识与学习路径\">前置知识与学习路径</h2><p><strong>前置</strong>：高中排列组合、集合与函数记号、基本的归纳证明；第二章的部分分式与第四章的有限域/群作用，建议同步参阅<a href=\"../abstract-algebra/\">抽象代数</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐路径</strong>：按章顺序阅读。具体分流——</p>\n<ul>\n<li>已有排列组合基础：可从<a href=\"recurrence-generating-functions/recurrence-relations\">第二章·递推关系</a>直接切入。</li>\n<li>偏应用方向（编码/实验设计）：学完第一章后跳读<a href=\"combinatorial-designs-applications/latin-squares\">第四章·拉丁方</a>与<a href=\"combinatorial-designs-applications/block-designs\">BIBD</a>，再回补中间章节。</li>\n<li>偏算法方向：第二章的<a href=\"recurrence-generating-functions/recurrence-relations\">主定理</a>与第四章的<a href=\"combinatorial-designs-applications/polya-counting-optimization\">组合优化</a>（匹配、拟阵、网络流）与<a href=\"../../cs-fundamentals/algorithms/\">算法 hub</a>互为表里。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每篇文档都含定理证明思路、可手算的具体示例、why/权衡/反模式与跨 hub 交叉链接，适合边学边练。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"counting-principles","title":"计数原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/counting-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"permutations-combinations","title":"排列组合与计数法则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/counting-principles/permutations-combinations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"binomial-theorem","title":"二项式定理与组合恒等式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/counting-principles/binomial-theorem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multinomial-theorem","title":"多项式定理与广义计数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/counting-principles/multinomial-theorem"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"recurrence-generating-functions","title":"递推与生成函数","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/recurrence-generating-functions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"recurrence-relations","title":"递推关系与求解方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/recurrence-generating-functions/recurrence-relations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"generating-functions","title":"生成函数基础与技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/recurrence-generating-functions/generating-functions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"catalan-numbers","title":"Catalan 数与经典序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/recurrence-generating-functions/catalan-numbers"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"inclusion-exclusion-pigeonhole","title":"容斥与鸽巢原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/inclusion-exclusion-pigeonhole","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inclusion-exclusion","title":"容斥原理与错位排列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/inclusion-exclusion-pigeonhole/inclusion-exclusion"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pigeonhole-ramsey","title":"鸽巢原理与 Ramsey 理论入门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/inclusion-exclusion-pigeonhole/pigeonhole-ramsey"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sieve-methods-probability","title":"筛法与组合概率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/inclusion-exclusion-pigeonhole/sieve-methods-probability"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"combinatorial-designs-applications","title":"组合设计与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/combinatorial-designs-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"latin-squares","title":"拉丁方与正交设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/combinatorial-designs-applications/latin-squares"},{"seq":2,"slug":"block-designs","title":"区组设计与 BIBD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/combinatorial-designs-applications/block-designs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"polya-counting-optimization","title":"Pólya 计数与组合优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorics/combinatorial-designs-applications/polya-counting-optimization"}]}]}